<script data-page="app" type="application/json">{"component":"flashcards\/study","props":{"errors":{},"name":"Topwords","auth":{"user":{"id":5,"name":"\u00c1rp\u00e1d Szaniszl\u00f3","email":"developedbybarley@gmail.com","email_verified_at":null,"two_factor_confirmed_at":null,"streak":10,"quiz_completions":1,"text_analyses":14,"last_activity_date":"2026-06-10T00:00:00.000000Z","onboarding_completed_at":"2026-04-18T19:40:25.000000Z","created_at":"2026-04-18T19:40:03.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-06-10T10:48:09.000000Z","stripe_id":"cus_UR8u0ziMkWwJIo","pm_type":null,"pm_last_four":null,"trial_ends_at":null,"ai_access":false,"subscriptions":[]},"isAdmin":true,"subscription":{"hasActiveAccess":true,"isSubscribed":false,"isPremium":false,"hasAiAccess":false,"isOnTrial":false}},"sidebarOpen":false,"flash":{"streakTriggered":null,"success":null,"achievements":[],"calibrationPrompt":null,"showTour":false,"importedCardId":null},"deck":{"id":38,"name":"May"},"cards":[{"id":51391,"front":"<p>It took years of therapy for her to finally _______ her fear of public speaking. <em>(lek\u00fczd \/ fel\u00fclkerekedik)<\/em><\/p><p>The team showed incredible resilience to _______ a two-goal deficit and win the match. <em>(ledolgoz \/ \u00e1thidal)<\/em><\/p><p>Researchers are working to _______ the challenges of developing a new vaccine. <em>(megold \/ kezel)<\/em><\/p><p>Though sorrow may _______ us for a time, hope will eventually return. <em>(elbor\u00edt \/ uralm\u00e1ba ker\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">lek\u00fczd \/ fel\u00fclkerekedik \/ \u00e1thidal<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): al\u00e1veti mag\u00e1t \/ megadja mag\u00e1t \/ elbukik<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a challenge = kih\u00edv\u00e1st lek\u00fczd (pl. They worked hard to _______ a challenge.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ an obstacle = akad\u00e1lyt lek\u00fczd (pl. We must _______ every obstacle in our path.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ fear = f\u00e9lelmet legy\u0151z (pl. It takes courage to _______ fear.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ difficulties = neh\u00e9zs\u00e9geket legy\u0151z (pl. They managed to _______ many difficulties.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>overcome<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>overcome<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: overcome adversity \/ overcome shyness \/ overcome resistance \/ overcome an addiction<\/span><\/p><p>similar: conquer \/ defeat \/ surmount \/ vanquish<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: succumb \/ yield \/ surrender<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-01","reviewed_on":"2026-06-09","due_at":"2026-06-09T19:25:27+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-06-09T18:58:31+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-01","reviewed_on":"2026-06-09"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"1 nap","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-10T18:27:48+00:00"},{"id":51310,"front":"<p>The government is expected to _______ a state of emergency due to the escalating crisis. <em>(kihirdet \/ bejelent)<\/em><\/p><p>She decided to _______ her love for him openly, despite the potential consequences. <em>(kinyilv\u00e1n\u00edt \/ vall)<\/em><\/p><p>All goods brought into the country must be properly _______ at customs. <em>(bev\u00e1mol \/ bejelent)<\/em><\/p><p>The artist chose to _______ his new exhibition with a bold and provocative statement. <em>(megnyit \/ bevezet)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">kijelent \/ kinyilv\u00e1n\u00edt \/ bejelent<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): elhallgat \/ titkol \/ tagad<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ war = h\u00e1bor\u00fat \u00fczen\/kihirdet (pl. Nations often _______ war after diplomatic efforts fail.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ a dividend = osztal\u00e9kot fizet\/kihirdet (pl. The company decided to _______ a dividend to its shareholders.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ one&#039;s intentions = kinyilv\u00e1n\u00edtja sz\u00e1nd\u00e9kait (pl. It&#039;s important to _______ your intentions clearly in negotiations.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ bankruptcy = cs\u0151d\u00f6t jelent (pl. Many businesses were forced to _______ bankruptcy during the recession.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>declare<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>declarative<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>declaration<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>declare<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: declare war \/ declare independence \/ declare a winner \/ declare a state of emergency<\/span><\/p><p>similar: announce \/ proclaim \/ state \/ assert<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: conceal \/ hide \/ deny<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"declare\ndeclarative\ndeclaration","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":8,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":4,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-13","reviewed_on":"2026-06-02","due_at":"2026-06-10T07:54:58+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"review","due_at":"2026-06-01T19:39:18+00:00","interval":4,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":3,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-13","reviewed_on":"2026-05-28"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"10 nap","good":"16 nap","easy":"21 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-16T16:54:02+00:00"},{"id":51326,"front":"<p>When making your decision, you should _______ the long-term consequences. <em>(figyelembe vesz \/ tekintettel van valamire)<\/em><\/p><p>The committee will _______ the historical context when reviewing the proposal. <em>(m\u00e9rlegel \/ sz\u00e1m\u00edt\u00e1sba vesz)<\/em><\/p><p>It is important to _______ the cultural differences when communicating internationally. <em>(tiszteletben tart \/ szem el\u0151tt tart)<\/em><\/p><p>The new policy will _______ the needs of all stakeholders. <em>(\u00e9rdekeit szem el\u0151tt tartja \/ figyelembe veszi)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">figyelembe vesz \/ tekintettel van valamire \/ m\u00e9rlegel<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): figyelmen k\u00edv\u00fcl hagy \/ mell\u0151z \/ semmibe vesz<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ the feelings of others = figyelembe veszi m\u00e1sok \u00e9rz\u00e9seit (pl. Always _______ the feelings of others before speaking.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ the safety regulations = betartja a biztons\u00e1gi el\u0151\u00edr\u00e1sokat (pl. All employees must _______ the safety regulations.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ the advice = megfogadja a tan\u00e1csot (pl. You should _______ the advice of your doctor.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ the law = betartja a t\u00f6rv\u00e9nyt (pl. Citizens are expected to _______ the law.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>Have regard to<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>regard<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>have regard to<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: have due regard to \/ have proper regard to \/ have special regard to \/ have little regard to<\/span><\/p><p>similar: take into account \/ consider \/ bear in mind \/ pay attention to<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: disregard \/ ignore \/ overlook<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"Have regard to","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":1,"ease_factor":230,"repetitions":1,"lapses":1,"learning_step":2,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-19","reviewed_on":"2026-06-08","due_at":"2026-06-09T19:43:21+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-06-08T02:01:15+00:00","interval":1,"ease_factor":230,"repetitions":1,"lapses":1,"learning_step":2,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-19","reviewed_on":"2026-06-06"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 nap","good":"2 nap","easy":"3 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-14T14:19:46+00:00"},{"id":51294,"front":"<p>I have no idea _______ what happened to the keys. <em>(egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n \/ semmif\u00e9le)<\/em><\/p><p>There was no evidence _______ to suggest he was involved. <em>(egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n \/ semmi)<\/em><\/p><p>She received no support _______ from her family during the difficult time. <em>(semmilyen \/ egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n)<\/em><\/p><p>The new policy had no impact _______ on the company&#039;s profits. <em>(egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n \/ semmi)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n \/ semmilyen \/ semmi<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): valamennyi \/ b\u00e1rmilyen \/ sok<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 nothing _______ = egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n semmi (pl. There was nothing _______ left.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 no one _______ = egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n senki (pl. No one _______ believed him.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 none _______ = egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n egy sem (pl. None _______ of them showed up.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 no reason _______ = egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n semmi ok (pl. There&#039;s no reason _______ to worry.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>whatsoever<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>whatsoever<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: nothing whatsoever \/ no one whatsoever \/ none whatsoever \/ no reason whatsoever<\/span><\/p><p>similar: at all \/ in any way \/ of any kind \/ in the slightest<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: any \/ some \/ a lot<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":4,"ease_factor":235,"repetitions":2,"lapses":1,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-11","reviewed_on":"2026-06-06","due_at":"2026-06-10T13:59:50+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"review","due_at":"2026-06-05T11:21:16+00:00","interval":2,"ease_factor":235,"repetitions":1,"lapses":1,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-11","reviewed_on":"2026-06-03"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"5 nap","good":"8 nap","easy":"10 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-11T16:55:27+00:00"},{"id":51412,"front":"<p>The committee will review all submitted _______ before making a final decision. <em>(javaslat \/ ind\u00edtv\u00e1ny)<\/em><\/p><p>He got down on one knee and made a romantic _______ to his girlfriend. <em>(l\u00e1nyk\u00e9r\u00e9s \/ h\u00e1zass\u00e1gi aj\u00e1nlat)<\/em><\/p><p>The company&#039;s _______ for the new project was rejected due to budget constraints. <em>(aj\u00e1nlat \/ tervezet)<\/em><\/p><p>After much discussion, they finally agreed on a mutually beneficial _______. <em>(javaslat \/ meg\u00e1llapod\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">javaslat \/ aj\u00e1nlat \/ l\u00e1nyk\u00e9r\u00e9s<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): elutas\u00edt\u00e1s \/ visszautas\u00edt\u00e1s \/ ellenvet\u00e9s<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 make a _______ = javaslatot tesz (pl. She made a compelling _______ for the new marketing strategy.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 accept a _______ = elfogad egy javaslatot\/aj\u00e1nlatot (pl. The board voted to accept the _______ for the merger.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 reject a _______ = elutas\u00edt egy javaslatot\/aj\u00e1nlatot (pl. They had to reject the _______ due to lack of funds.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 business _______ = \u00fczleti aj\u00e1nlat (pl. We received several business _______s for the contract.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 marriage _______ = h\u00e1zass\u00e1gi aj\u00e1nlat (pl. He planned a surprise marriage _______ during their vacation.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>proposal<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>proposal<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>propose<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: make a proposal \/ accept a proposal \/ reject a proposal \/ business proposal<\/span><\/p><p>similar: suggestion \/ offer \/ plan \/ proposition<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: rejection \/ refusal \/ withdrawal<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"proposal","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":2,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":1,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-04","reviewed_on":"2026-06-08","due_at":"2026-06-10T07:46:07+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-06-07T20:17:38+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":3,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-04","reviewed_on":"2026-06-07"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"3 nap","good":"4 nap","easy":"5 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-10T07:51:54+00:00"},{"id":51403,"front":"<p>The photographer managed to _______ the fleeting moment of the bird taking flight. <em>(meg\u00f6r\u00f6k\u00edt \/ lef\u00e9nyk\u00e9pez)<\/em><\/p><p>After a long chase, the police were finally able to _______ the suspect. <em>(elfog \/ letart\u00f3ztat)<\/em><\/p><p>The new marketing campaign aims to _______ the attention of young consumers. <em>(megragad \/ felkelt)<\/em><\/p><p>The artist tried to _______ the essence of the city&#039;s vibrant nightlife in his painting. <em>(megragad \/ kifejez)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">elfog \/ megragad \/ meg\u00f6r\u00f6k\u00edt<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): elenged \/ szabadon enged \/ elvesz\u00edt<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ an image = k\u00e9pet r\u00f6gz\u00edt\/meg\u00f6r\u00f6k\u00edt (pl. The camera can _______ an image in less than a second.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ attention = figyelmet megragad\/felkelt (pl. The bright colors helped to _______ attention.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ a feeling\/mood = \u00e9rz\u00e9st\/hangulatot megragad\/kifejez (pl. The music managed to _______ the melancholic mood perfectly.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ a market share = piaci r\u00e9szesed\u00e9st szerez\/megkaparint (pl. The company hopes to _______ a larger market share with its new product.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ a prize = d\u00edjat nyer\/elnyer (pl. She managed to _______ first prize in the competition.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>capture<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>capture<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>capture<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: capture the moment \/ capture the essence \/ capture attention \/ capture a suspect<\/span><\/p><p>similar: apprehend \/ seize \/ trap \/ snare<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: release \/ free \/ lose<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"capture","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":4,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-03","reviewed_on":"2026-06-08","due_at":"2026-06-09T19:53:26+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-06-07T21:14:35+00:00","inter