"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"3 nap","good":"4 nap","easy":"5 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-10T18:42:48+00:00"},{"id":51347,"front":"<p>The punishment seemed _______ to the minor offense committed. <em>(ar\u00e1nytalan \/ t\u00falzott)<\/em><\/p><p>There&#039;s a _______ number of women in leadership roles compared to men in this industry. <em>(ar\u00e1nytalanul kev\u00e9s \/ egyenl\u0151tlen)<\/em><\/p><p>The economic benefits were distributed in a _______ manner, favoring the wealthy. <em>(ar\u00e1nytalanul \/ egyenl\u0151tlen\u00fcl)<\/em><\/p><p>He felt a _______ sense of guilt for something that wasn&#039;t entirely his fault. <em>(t\u00falzott \/ indokolatlanul nagy)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">ar\u00e1nytalan \/ ar\u00e1nytalanul nagy \/ egyenl\u0151tlen<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): ar\u00e1nyos \/ kiegyens\u00falyozott \/ egyenletes<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ share = ar\u00e1nytalan r\u00e9sz (pl. They received a _______ share of the profits.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ amount = ar\u00e1nytalan mennyis\u00e9g (pl. He spent a _______ amount of time on a minor detail.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ burden = ar\u00e1nytalan teher (pl. The new taxes placed a _______ burden on low-income families.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 grossly _______ = durv\u00e1n ar\u00e1nytalan (pl. The sentence was considered grossly _______ by many.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>disproportionate<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>disproportionate<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>disproportionately<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>disproportion<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: disproportionate impact \/ disproportionate number \/ disproportionate amount \/ disproportionate response<\/span><\/p><p>similar: unequal \/ imbalanced \/ excessive \/ incommensurate<\